# VoodBuilder — companion & SDK APIs

- Register modules with `Voodbuilder::registerModule()` during `Application::booting()`
- Prefer facade methods (`editorBlock`, `editorServerBlock`, `contentChannel`, `menuItemType`, …) over touching registries directly
- Use entitlements (`can` / `cannot`) — never hard-code SKU/edition strings
- Peer pattern: Vforms/Vpopups/etc. soft-gate with `class_exists` and register modules; core must not hard-require them
- Host integrations: `config/voodbuilder-integrations.php` or AppServiceProvider
- Docs: `docs/developer/companion-integration.md`, `docs/manual/developer/extending-overview.md`, `docs/SDK_PLUGIN_API.md`
